<title>JAPAN: Tokai Kanko bid-only after tie-up news.</title>
<headline>Tokai Kanko bid-only after tie-up news.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokai Kanko Co Ltd shares were bid-only on Friday morning after the company said on Thursday it had decided on an equity and business tie-up with Hong Kong's Far East Consortium International Ltd, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0041 GMT it was bid-only at 150 yen, after closing at 140 yen on the previous day.</p>
